## WHAT THE OUTPUT MUST NOT CONTAIN

This is critical. The generated file must NOT include any of the following:
- Code snippets or implementation examples
- File lists of what to create or modify (that's in tasks.md)
- Architecture descriptions or design decisions (that's in specification.md)
- Dependency graphs or stage descriptions (that's in plan.md)
- "Common patterns", "key constraints", "implementation notes", or "context and references" sections
- Links to external documentation
- Anything that duplicates content from the pipeline files

The AI coding agent will read the full specs. The CLAUDE.md/Agents.md just tells it WHERE to find them and HOW to work through them. Keep it short.
